<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62675" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκό-ϊον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], τό</span>, for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκὸν ἴον</span>, lit. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>white-violet</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>gilliflower, Matthiola incana</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.123
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>snowdrop, Galanthus nivalis</i>, flowering very early, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.8.1
			</span></i>; joined with the narcissus and lily in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.143
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				146
			</span></i> (Id.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τὸ μέλαν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴον τὸ μέλαν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				32
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
